{"reviewId": "409057426_8dcgNh0nL", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "这张是我的理解生成的（虽然没太大区别），把长期趋势线和实际经济水平线想象成两个人在直道上赛跑，当实际经济水平线领先时就是繁荣和衰退，长期趋势线领先时就是萧条和回升。繁荣的中点是速度最快时，末尾是速度与长期趋势线相同时，衰退是速度比长期趋势线慢、长期趋势线跑在前面时，萧条是速度开始慢慢追上长期趋势线，但实际距离还是在拉开，而回升则是速度大于长期趋势线，落后但距离在接近。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "2025-2121", "abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "flag": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "409057426_8dcgNh0nL", "userVid": 409057426, "topics": [], "createTime": 1793198823, "pictures": [{"url": "https://weread-picture-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/26/Es10rG0iC7GG0OI749.jpg", "width": 2932, "height": 1713}], "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 409057426, "name": "知行知", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELcKg6RWckTBOwWdbic0gn7sdcK5b4NQbAPq7NUdMjn7GH1rAnVg6oZpJicJfg91DibEYt5jsMo08fe14CiaWAub7h6BRQW7cC49oIubCXYAObkwQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "知行知", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 379349210, "name": "猪精", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/kSiaeFj92SMwW3TJUxETehbMhDZYts1u0MvFDtPVia6oSoCZ2pldmibmGFaz4Y36P1AicSyyGjAbpib8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "和 Ai 聊了一下，这是修订版：\n两个人匀速赛道赛跑：\n• A = 长期趋势选手：固定匀速向前跑（斜率恒定）\n• B = 实际经济选手：速度忽快忽慢\n1. 繁荣：B跑的速度 > A，B不断拉开领先距离；B在繁荣中点达到自己的最高速度，之后B开始减速，但速度依然比A快，距离还在拉大，直到B到达最远领先位置（繁荣末尾，B的速度降到0，B不再往前、准备回头）\n2. 衰退：B速度 < A，B还在A前面（位置领先），但是A在慢慢追赶，二者差距持续缩小；直到衰退终点，A追上B（两条线交汇，康波阶段顶）\n3. 萧条：交点之后A跑到前面，B的速度继续弱于A，二者的距离持续越拉越大，直到B跌到自己的最低点（萧条末尾）\n4. 回升：B调整过来，B速度 > A；虽然B位置还落后，但是B跑得更快，持续缩小和A的距离，直到回升终点B再次追上A，开启新一轮繁荣。", "reviewId": "409057426_8dcgNh0nL", "commentId": "409057426_8dcgNh0nL_c409057426_8dchgAcBp", "userVid": 409057426, "createTime": 1793199256, "author": {"userVid": 409057426, "name": "知行知", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELcKg6RWckTBOwWdbic0gn7sdcK5b4NQbAPq7NUdMjn7GH1rAnVg6oZpJicJfg91DibEYt5jsMo08fe14CiaWAub7h6BRQW7cC49oIubCXYAObkwQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "知行知", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1793250822}